# Internal working documents (never publish to the public repo):
# audit reports, pre-launch checklists, UI proposals, architecture reviews.
# They contain local machine paths (e.g. the privacy audit's E:\github\...),
# candid pre-launch assessments, and identity-audit details. Durable
# decisions live in docs/adr/ + docs/wayfinder/ + CONTEXT.md instead;
# these are working history kept on disk only.
internal/

